    host: refresh systemd instance links across package switches
    
    Systemd can leave instance aliases and enablement links pointing directly
    at an older Nix package. Once that package is collected, an instance link
    shadows the valid current template and prevents the provider worker from
    starting.
    
    Refresh existing packaged-unit links through the stable profile and local
    templates during activation. Preserve custom units and disabled workers.
    Exercise collected-package links in the host regression and packaged
    creation acceptance before checking usable conversations.

